  {
   "id": "smelter-119191@post-2021-04-23",
   "gameId": "smelter-119191",
   "displayName": "Another round of fixes to brighten up your day",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2021-04-23T16:38:04.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey all!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The team has been working hard to address several mild and, more importantly, a couple of critical issues that players have been experiencing. While although we're not happy these made it into the release, we are happy to say that we've hopefully knocked out a few of them!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We'll be keeping a close eye on things to make sure things behave as they should.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For an idea of what we have put into this version, check out the list below!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "### Platformer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(fix) Some localization related visuals fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(update) Valenos Trial room updated",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(update) Hectos Trial room updated: ### Strategy",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(fix) Returning to main menu would carry over the dialogue in some situations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(fix) Gurabi shmup has been adjusted to prevent potential soft-locking issues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(fix) Gurabi Quest 1 enemies could spawn outside the area in rare cases",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(update) Collectibles in the strategy now have an effect added to them to make them more visible",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(update) Damzella's speech bubble size has been adjusted",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(update) Nutoro shmup miniboss balancing has been adjusted: ### Others",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(fix) Initial default settings was breaking in some circumstances",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(fix) Initial settings on first start up was having an issue causing the screen to be very dark in some cases (didn't initialize default settings properly)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
